WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.660
And we found a lot of these children, and we're sending them back, and we've been sending

00:04.660 --> 00:06.240
them back to their parents.

00:06.240 --> 00:10.020
They said, nobody knows who they are, they said, where do you come from, and they'll

00:10.020 --> 00:13.160
give us a country, and we'll find out, and we'll figure it out, and we'll bring them

00:13.160 --> 00:13.940
back to their home.

